  <h1 class=3D"slds-text-heading_large" lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D"">Unify Source P=
rofiles</h1>
 =20
  <p lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D"">Use identity resolution in <span lwc-3eigj2skqo3=
=3D"">Data 360</span> to consolidate data from
    different sources into comprehensive views of your customers and accoun=
ts. Identity resolution
    uses matching and reconciliation rules to link data about people or acc=
ounts into unified
    profiles. Identity resolution creates complete, actionable views of you=
r customers but doesn=E2=80=99t
    create golden records and isn=E2=80=99t a master data management (MDM) =
system. Each unified profile
    contains all the unique contact point values from all sources. You choo=
se which view of your
    customers to use based on each business use case you want to solve.</p>

    <div class=3D"slds-box slds-box_x-small slds-theme_shade slds-m-top_med=
ium slds-m-bottom_medium" lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D""><div class=3D"slds-media sld=
s-media_responsive" lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D""><div class=3D"slds-media__figure" =
lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D""><span class=3D"slds-icon_container slds-icon_container=
_circle slds-icon-note-note" lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D""><img alt=3D"Note" src=3D"=
https://sf-zdocs-cdn-prod.zoominsoftware.com/tdta-data_cloud-260-0-0-produc=
tion-enus/e598d5be-52c0-456c-9cf6-bd659c7bb443/images/icon_note.png" style=
=3D"margin-bottom:0;" lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D""></span></div><div style=3D"paddi=
ng-top:.5rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;" class=3D"slds-media__body" lwc-3eigj2sk=
qo3=3D""><span class=3D"slds-text-title_caps" lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D"">Note</sp=
an>=20
        <p lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D"">As of October 14, 2025, Data Cloud has been=
 rebranded to Data 360. During this
          transition, you may see references to Data Cloud in our applicati=
on and documentation.
          While the name is new, the functionality and content remains unch=
anged.</p>
      </div></div></div>

    <p lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D"">Unified profile data empowers your reps to sell=
, service, and market more effectively with
      360-degree views of each customer.</p>
    <ul lwc-3eigj2skqo3=3D"">
